-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
DCC model train captures
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Captures of a Lenz LG100 brake module operated on an LZ100 command station.


Logic analyzer setup
--------------------

The logic analyzer used was a nanoDLA (samplerate 12MHz).

  Probe       DCC
  ------------------
  0           P track
  1           N track


Captures
--------

  Capture  Action
  --------------------------------------------------------
  lg100.sr LZ100 output until ~8s, LG100 output afterwards